---
import MBPRLayout from "../layouts/MBPRLayout.astro";
---
<MBPRLayout title="Donate | Mission Bay Puppy Rescue" description="Support Mission Bay Puppy Rescue with a one-time or monthly donation, workplace giving, or a wish-list gift.">
<section class="page-intro">
  <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center;">Every Dollar Keeps Us Saying Yes</span>
    <h1>Help Us Keep Saying Yes</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;">Your gift covers vet bills, surgeries, food, and love for pups who have nowhere else to go.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="max-width:820px; margin:0 auto; background:var(--white); border:1px solid var(--sand-line); border-radius:var(--radius-lg); box-shadow:var(--shadow-md); padding:38px;">
      <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:18px; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px;">
        <h3 style="margin:0;">Give Monthly</h3>
        <span class="tag-count" style="background:var(--gold-pale); color:var(--gold-deep); font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.8rem; padding:6px 14px; border-radius:100px;">[Club Name] <span class="draft-flag">Content Needed</span></span>
      </div>
      <p style="opacity:.75; margin-bottom:22px;">A recurring gift means we can plan ahead for the pups who need us most &mdash; not just react. [DRAFT &mdash; MBPR-specific monthly amount &amp; story, e.g. tied to founding year or a meaningful rescue milestone]<span class="draft-flag">Content Needed</span></p>
      <div class="grid grid-4" style="gap:12px; margin-bottom:22px;">
        <button class="btn btn-outline btn-block" type="button">$&#8203;__ /mo</button>
        <button class="btn btn-outline btn-block" type="button">$&#8203;__ /mo</button>
        <button class="btn btn-gold btn-block" type="button">$&#8203;__ /mo</button>
        <button class="btn btn-outline btn-block" type="button">Other</button>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-navy btn-block" href="#">Give Monthly</a>
      <div style="text-align:center; margin:18px 0; opacity:.5; font-size:.85rem;">or make a one-time gift</div>
      <a class="btn btn-outline btn-block" href="#">Give Once</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section sand-deep">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center; display:flex;">What It Costs</span>
    <h2 style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:10px;">Every Pup, From Rescue To Home</h2>
    <p class="lede" style="text-align:center; margin:0 auto 30px;">A puppy&rsquo;s care adds up quickly &mdash; here&rsquo;s where a typical gift goes.</p>
    <div class="cost-orbit">
      <div class="cost-bubble"><span class="dot"></span> <b>Vaccinations</b>&nbsp;&amp; wellness exams</div>
      <div class="cost-bubble"><span class="dot"></span> <b>Spay / Neuter</b> surgery</div>
      <div class="cost-bubble"><span class="dot"></span> <b>Microchipping</b></div>
      <div class="cost-bubble"><span class="dot"></span> <b>Food</b>&nbsp;&amp; daily care</div>
      <div class="cost-bubble"><span class="dot"></span> <b>Emergency</b>&nbsp;medical care</div>
      <div class="cost-bubble"><span class="dot"></span> <b>Foster</b>&nbsp;supplies</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Transparency</span>
      <h2>Where Your Donation Goes</h2>
      <p style="opacity:.8; margin-bottom:18px;">[DRAFT &mdash; real category breakdown, pending MoneyMinder numbers]<span class="draft-flag">Content Needed</span></p>
      <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;">
        <div>
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:.86rem; margin-bottom:6px;"><span>Veterinary &amp; Medical</span><span>&mdash;%</span></div>
          <div class="progress"><div class="fill" style="width:62%;"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:.86rem; margin-bottom:6px;"><span>Food &amp; Supplies</span><span>&mdash;%</span></div>
          <div class="progress"><div class="fill" style="width:22%;"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:.86rem; margin-bottom:6px;"><span>Operations</span><span>&mdash;%</span></div>
          <div class="progress"><div class="fill" style="width:16%;"></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="background:var(--lagoon-pale); border-radius:var(--radius-lg); padding:32px;">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:10px;">Why Our Adoption Fee Is $800</h3>
      <p style="opacity:.85;">[DRAFT &mdash; explain what the $800 adoption fee covers: vaccines, spay/neuter, microchip, and care leading up to adoption day, so it reads as value rather than a price tag]<span class="draft-flag">Content Needed</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section sand-deep">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">More Ways To Give</span>
    <h2 style="margin-bottom:30px;">Beyond A One-Time Gift</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="action-block">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3.5" y="8" width="17" height="11" rx="1.5"/><path d="M8 8V6a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v2"/><path d="M3.5 13h17"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Workplace Giving</h3>
        <p>Many employers match donations. We&rsquo;re listed on Benevity [and DRAFT &mdash; second platform name]<span class="draft-flag">Content Needed</span>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="action-block gold">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="9" width="16" height="11" rx="1.2"/><path d="M4 13h16"/><path d="M12 9v11"/><path d="M12 9C10.5 9 8.5 8 8.5 6.2 8.5 5 9.4 4 10.6 4c1.6 0 1.9 2.5 1.4 5zM12 9c1.5 0 3.5-1 3.5-2.8 0-1.2-.9-2.2-2.1-2.2-1.6 0-1.9 2.5-1.4 5z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Corporate Sponsorship</h3>
        <p>Meaningful partnerships that provide substantial, ongoing support for our mission.</p>
        <a class="link-quiet" href="/contact">Inquire &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="action-block seafoam">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13l3 3 4-4"/><path d="M12 20s-6-3.7-7.6-7.2C3.6 10.5 5 8 7.3 8c1.3 0 2.2.8 2.7 1.4.5-.6 1.4-1.4 2.7-1.4 2.3 0 3.7 2.5 2.9 4.8-.4 1.1-1 2.1-1.6 3"/><path d="M12 4l1.5 1.5L15 4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Legacy Giving</h3>
        <p>Include MBPR in a will, trust, or estate plan. [DRAFT copy]<span class="draft-flag">Content Needed</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container split reverse">
    <div class="media" style="order:2;">
      <img src="https://missionbaypuppyrescue.org/cdn/shop/files/black-white-puppy-floppy-ears-bright-eyes_1024x1024.webp?v=1738512467" alt="A puppy cared for by Mission Bay Puppy Rescue">
    </div>
    <div style="order:1;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Wish List</span>
      <h2>Give Exactly What The Pups Need</h2>
      <p style="opacity:.8; margin-bottom:20px;">Rather than dropping off used items, our Amazon Wish List and gift cards let us get exactly what&rsquo;s needed &mdash; no storage, no waste.</p>
      <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:14px;">
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#">Amazon Wish List</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#">PetSmart Gift Cards</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</MBPRLayout>